                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The Community of Practice Roundtable on Coherence was aimed at creating a dialogue around two major topics linked to coherence. The discussion was focused on: addressing the current problems and challenges of coherence between the actors involved in peacebuilding and conflict prevention, and highlighting the economic dimension of conflict prevention and peacebuilding through the role of private sector, and the link to economic diplomacy. The event was followed by an open debate including comments from civil society and policymakers. "
